# Line endings and binary handling.
# Media is stored as regular Git files (not Git LFS) so static hosts such as
# Hostinger receive the real image and video bytes on clone.
* text=auto

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.avif binary

*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.webm binary
*.m4v binary

*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.aac binary
*.m4a binary

*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
